{"id":1812179,"retrievedAt":"2026-10-30T17:23:38.145Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/29eexeRYbYYxmYmaQYW2hPHNk4L.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"https://www.apselutelyfakt.com/a-stranger-has-no-eyes","id":1812179,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["NO"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Àlejò Ò L’Ójú","overview":"In Benin, a descendant of one of history's most notorious slave traders publicly confronts the legacy of her own family. But when Martine de Souza unexpectedly becomes second-in-command of the powerful de Souza dynasty, she is forced to choose between protecting a legacy built on slavery or challenging it from within. Told through mesmerising Vodu ceremonies in which the enslaved return from the dead to possess the living, A Stranger Has No Eyes is a formally adventurous meditation on the contradictions of colonialism, shining a light on ways in which power, memory, belief and identity continue to shape the present.","popularity":0.0388,"poster_path":"/llWURo59x0OSSDJ0pdRnSr9pvkK.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":316277,"logo_path":null,"name":"Nicholson Øye- og Øreverk","origin_country":""},{"id":316278,"logo_path":null,"name":"Herstory","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"NO","name":"Norway"}],"release_date":"2026-09-27","revenue":0,"runtime":129,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"English","iso_639_1":"en","name":"English"},{"english_name":"Yoruba","iso_639_1":"yo","name":"Èdè Yorùbá"},{"english_name":"French","iso_639_1":"fr","name":"Français"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"Never trust anybody.","title":"A Stranger Has No Eyes","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[{"iso_3166_1":"NO","title":"En fremmed har ei øyne","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"FR","title":"Un étranger n'a pas les yeux","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"DE","title":"Ein Fremder hat keine Augen","type":""}]},"credits":{"cast":[